    {
      "text": "You know, I don't know how many of you have been a staff eng for eight years with six years of direct sales experience and four years as a solution architect.",
      "timestamp_sec": 677,
      "why": "Quantifies the absurdity of composite FDE job postings."
    },
    {
      "text": "And so you think about the the dirty secret that it doesn't exist and actually it it either doesn't exist or maybe it actually exists too much.",
      "timestamp_sec": 677,
